I. ENTSOG — European Gas Flow Data
======================================================================

Platform : ENTSOG Transparency Platform (transparency.entsog.eu)
API      : /api/v1/AggregatedData, month-by-month pagination
Coverage : 2019-11-01 to 2026-04-29  (47,048 daily rows)
Output   : entsog_daily_selected.csv  |  entsog_weekly_panel.csv (5,388 rows)

Countries (7):
  DE  Germany
  FR  France
  IT  Italy
  NL  Netherlands
  ES  Spain
  UK  United Kingdom
  EU  Aggregate (sum of DE+FR+IT+NL+ES+UK)

Indicators (2):
  Physical Flow   — actual gas flows (GWh/day)
  Allocation      — nominated/allocated gas flows (GWh/day)

Weekly panel columns:
  countryKey   — ISO-2 country code
  indicator    — Physical Flow | Allocation
  week_start   — Monday of the ISO week
  twh_week     — total TWh for the week
  wow_pct      — week-over-week % change
  yoy_pct      — year-over-year % change (same week -52 weeks)

