III. FRED — HICP Inflation Indices (471 series)
======================================================================

Source   : Eurostat via FRED
Coverage : 28 EU member states + Euro Area + European Union aggregates
Period   : 1996-01-01 – 2026-03-01 (most series from 1996 or 1999)
Frequency: Monthly | Units: Index 2025=100 | NSA

Geographic breakdown:
  European Union aggregate      : 81 series
  Euro Area aggregate (EA-20)   : 52 series (some EA-19 variants)
  Each of 28 EU member states   : 12–13 series per country
    AT BE BG CY CZ DE DK EE ES FI FR GR HR HU IE
    IT LT LU LV MT NL PL PT RO SE SI SK

-- HICP Energy (total)  (72 series) --
  Overall HICP energy sub-index. Covers all energy products.
  Example: ENRGY0ATM086NEST — HICP: Energy for Austria

-- HICP Electricity+Gas+Solid Fuels  (47 series) --
  COICOP 04.5 — electricity, gas, solid fuels and heat energy.
  Example: ELGAS0ATM086NEST — HICP: Electricity, Gas, Solid Fuels for Austria

-- HICP Energy+Unprocessed Food  (36 series) --
  Combined energy + unprocessed food sub-index.
  Example: EFOODUATM086NEST — HICP: Energy and Unprocessed Food for Austria

-- HICP excl. Energy  (36 series) --
  Headline HICP excluding all energy products.
  Example: 00XE00ATM086NEST — HICP excl. Energy for Austria

-- HICP excl. Energy+Seasonal Food  (36 series) --
  Headline HICP excluding energy and seasonal food.
  Example: 00XESEATM086NEST — HICP excl. Energy+Seasonal Food for Austria

-- HICP excl. Energy+Unprocessed Food  (36 series) --
  Headline HICP excluding energy and unprocessed food.
  Example: 00XFUNATM086NEST — HICP excl. Energy+Unprocessed Food for Austria

-- HICP excl. Energy+Food+Alc+Tobacco  (33 series) --
  Core HICP (excl. energy, food, alcohol, tobacco). ~26 countries.
  Example: 00XEFDATM086NEST — HICP Core for Austria

-- HICP Other Energy (Heating/Cooling)  (25 series) --
  COICOP 04.5.5 — other fuels for heating/cooling. ~25 countries.
  Example: CP0455ATM086NEST — HICP Other Energy for Austria

-- HICP Electricity  (4 series) --
  Electricity only (Euro Area aggregates).
  Example: CP0451EZ19M086NEST — HICP Electricity for EA-19

-- HICP Other variants  (146 series) --
  Energy+Seasonal Food, Energy+Food, and other COICOP combinations.
  Includes oddly-named/code-only series; 5 per country typical.

